[{"title":"三角城","author":"魏初","text":"灵夏兵尘百战鏖，城根石壁矗云高。\n当时遗老今犹在，说是山前有界濠。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":10487,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"挽姨兄尚书刘公五首 其一","author":"魏初","text":"外家宅相悲零落，母氏风流记阿姨。\n独有吾兄今又去，百年亲话更谁知。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":10488,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"挽姨兄尚书刘公五首 其二","author":"魏初","text":"高梁河上十年别，白塔亭前再见时。\n万里风沙颜色黑，敝裘如结鬓如丝。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":10489,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"挽姨兄尚书刘公五首 其三","author":"魏初","text":"铁石心肠报主知，一生一死隔毫釐。\n旌旗日影丹墀上，三拜尚书亦自奇。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":10490,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"挽姨兄尚书刘公五首 其四","author":"魏初","text":"牧之萍梗寄吴东，南北音容只梦中。\n莫恨终天曾不见，天高留付若堂封。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":10491,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"挽姨兄尚书刘公五首 其五","author":"魏初","text":"中郎堂上尚书宅，才得从容又别离。\n今日归来亦衰病，两围秋草不胜悲。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":10492,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"许左丞哀挽","author":"魏初","text":"学道躬行意味真，爱君辞气见忠纯。\n千